+/// Packed bytes an entry may read before it has unpacked anything (Carrysheet patch).
+const FIRST_READ: u64 = 256 * 1024;
+
+/// How many packed bytes the zip reader may still read: unpacking is checked as it goes, so an
+/// entry that reads a lot and gives little (empty compressed blocks, seconds per megabyte) stops
